Command  Effect                       Valid Modes
-------  ------                       -----------
d        delete characters            x, x-y, x@y, <string>
D        delete lines                 x, x-y, x@y
i        insert characters            @x, <string>
I        insert lines                 @x
a        append characters            @x, <string>
A        append lines                 @x
E        edit lines                   @x
e        edit characters              @x, <string>
S        search                       x, x-y, x@y
R        search and replace           x, x-y, x@y
F        page forward                 x
B        page backward                x
U        undo commands                x
w        save and continue            <filename>
W        save and exit                <filename>
Q        quit, abandon file           none
O        open a new file              <filename>
c        copy chars. to clipboard     x, x-y, x@y, <string>
C        copy lines to clipboard      x, x-y, x@y
m        move chars. to clipboard     x, x-y, x@y, <string>
M        move lines to clipboard      x, x-y, x@y
V        view clipboard               none
^        show current ptr. pos.       none
p        paste chars. from clipboard  @x
P        paste lines from clipboard   @x
L        list lines                   x, x-y, x@y
T        test code                    <filename>
N        toggle line numbering        none
+        advance lines                x
-        back up lines                x
++       go to end of file            none
>        move char. pointer right     x, @x, <string>
<        move char. pointer left      x, @x, <string>
>>       move to end of line          none
<<       move to start of line        none
|        move to middle of line       none
<num>    go to line number <num>      none

H <command> for help on that command
H modes for help on command modes
H strings for help on correct string formation
